# Maintainer TLS reverse-proxy layer (VM-only — never commit; certs/keys)
/Caddyfile
/docker-compose.override.yml
/caddy/
*.pem
*.key

# UI-redesign working files + QA result dumps. Untracked, and NOT to be
# committed: their mock data uses real account names. v3.27.0 pulled them in
# via `git add -A` — in the commit titled "No personal data in the repository"
# — and they are still in that commit's history. Ignored here so the next
# sweeping add cannot repeat it. Also listed in deploy/make_public.py.
/prototype/
/storyboard.html
/ui-directions*.html
/qa/auto_test_results_*.csv
